1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,439
Koob shaah ah… immisa qaado sonkor ah ayaad ku shubtaa?

2
00:00:03,539 --> 00:00:05,963
Hal qaado oo sonkor ah waa ku dhawaad afar garaam.

3
00:00:06,063 --> 00:00:12,931
NHS-ka UK wuxuu sheegaa in qofka weyn uusan maalintii cunin wax ka badan 30 garaam oo sonkor lagu daray ah, ku dhawaad 7 qaado.

4
00:00:13,031 --> 00:00:19,854
Haddii aad maalintii cabto saddex koob, koob walbana saddex qaado ku shubto… waa sagaal qaado. Intaas oo shaah keliya!

5
00:00:19,954 --> 00:00:25,637
Sonkorta badan waxay kordhisaa miisaanka, cabitaannada macaanka badanna waxay kordhiyaan khatarta sonkorowga nooca labaad.

6
00:00:25,737 --> 00:00:39,212
Daraasad Minnesota: sonkorowgu wuxuu ku jiray 12% bukaannada Soomaalida, marka loo eego 5% kuwa kale. UK-gana, dadka Afrikaanka Madow sonkorowgu laba ilaa afar jeer ayuu u badan yahay, khatartuna waxay bilaabataa da'da 25.

7
00:00:39,312 --> 00:00:42,701
Sonkorowgu wuxuu dhaawici karaa indhaha, kelyaha, cagaha iyo wadnaha.

8
00:00:42,801 --> 00:00:51,324
Shaaha ha joojin! Toddobaad kasta hal qaado ka dhim, koob yar isticmaal, oo hayl iyo qorfe ku dar si uu u macaanaado. Sidoo kale iska baar sonkorta dhiigga.

9
00:00:51,424 --> 00:00:56,838
Talo caafimaad maaha, la tasho dhakhtarkaaga. Adiga… immisa qaado ayaad ku shubtaa?
